#: 9e0fe706f97d4cd68f01a8bfc84d6c2f
msgid "Recipe 4: Group `ScalarField` objects with `FieldList` / `FieldDict`"
msgstr "差分レシピ 4: `ScalarField` を `FieldList` / `FieldDict` でまとめる"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:154
#: cd03259dc8de4efe9e09420de57fe927
msgid ""
"Typical GWpy migration paths focus on series-like objects, and GWpy does "
"not provide a standard container layer for field-like data with shared "
"spatial metadata. In GWexpy, you can keep a single field in `ScalarField`"
" and manage multiple related fields through `FieldList` / `FieldDict`."
msgstr ""
"GWpy の標準的な移行対象は `TimeSeries` "
"系が中心で、空間軸を持つフィールドコンテナや、そのコレクションに対応する標準クラスはありません。 GWexpy では、単一のフィールドを "
"`ScalarField` で保持し、複数のフィールドを `FieldList` / `FieldDict` で一括管理できます。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:189
#: b1e37993c38641068f6a11d348c0114b
msgid ""
"you want multiple fields to share unit/axis/domain checks instead of "
"managing metadata by hand"
msgstr "同じ軸・単位・ドメインを共有する複数のフィールドをまとめて扱いたいとき"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:190
#: d833c10beb81491c93812082cbeae8c6
