msgstr "[インストールガイド](../tutorials/installation.md)"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:242
#: 1299ce2c4be14a23b337aeea0819db10
msgid "Recipe 6: Bridge to python-control"
msgstr "差分レシピ 6: python-control との橋渡し"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:244
#: 9c6f945b7ebc46a6a87582091a8f53fc
msgid ""
"In GWpy-based code, using `control.bode()` or similar functions requires "
"manually extracting a `FrequencySeries` value as a numpy array and "
"passing it to `control.frd()`.   In GWexpy, `to_control_frd()` handles "
"the conversion in one call, removing that boilerplate."
msgstr ""
"GWpy ベースのコードでは、`control.bode()` などの関数を使うために、`FrequencySeries` の値を numpy "
"配列として手動で取り出し、`control.frd()` に渡す必要があります。GWexpy では `to_control_frd()` が 1 "
"回の呼び出しで変換を処理し、その定型コードを不要にします。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:281
#: 071e261c1efe4efc8d358f7c157cdf3a
msgid ""
"you want to treat an ASD / PSD spectrum directly as a control-system FRD "
"model"
msgstr "ASD / PSD スペクトルをそのまま制御系の FRD モデルとして扱いたいとき"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:282
#: 54c268ddede746ab8d52d38bff3d83ca
msgid ""
"you want to skip manual numpy extraction before passing data to "
"`control.bode()` / `control.nichols()` / `control.nyquist()`"
msgstr ""
"`control.bode()` / `control.nichols()` / `control.nyquist()` に渡す前の numpy "
"配列取り出し処理を省きたいとき"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:283
#: eb3274fe8b794ae581256f9ec3a39bb4
msgid ""
"you want to restore a processed FRD back to a `FrequencySeries` and feed "
"it into an existing plot or statistics pipeline"
msgstr "解析結果の FRD を GWexpy の `FrequencySeries` に戻して既存のプロット・統計処理パイプラインに繋げたいとき"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:284
