msgid "Where GWexpy sits relative to other GWpy-adjacent packages"
msgstr "GWpy 周辺の他パッケージとの位置関係"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:295
#: de6257e9138449079970b4ac4977cec6
msgid ""
"GWexpy is not the only package that extends GWpy, and moving to it does "
"not mean leaving the rest of the ecosystem behind. spicypy adds signal-"
"processing and control-systems methods, GWDama organises data into HDF5 "
"datasets for later analysis, and the detector-characterization tools "
"build operator-facing workflows on top of GWpy. GWexpy occupies the "
"container, I/O, and analysis-primitive layer between GWpy and those "
"workflows, so the usual pattern is to combine them rather than to choose "
"one."
msgstr ""
"GWpy を拡張するパッケージは GWexpy だけではなく、GWexpy へ移行してもエコシステムの残りを"
"手放すことにはなりません。spicypy は信号処理と制御系の手法を追加し、GWDama は後段の解析の"
"ためにデータを HDF5 データセットへ整理し、detector characterization 系のツールは GWpy の"
"上にオペレータ向けワークフローを構築します。GWexpy は GWpy とそれらのワークフローの間にある"
"コンテナ・I/O・解析プリミティブの層を担うため、どれか一つを選ぶのではなく組み合わせて使うのが"
"通常の形です。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:302
#: 0caa759633224c47843f6f831db93e6a
msgid ""
"For the full comparison, including which projects GWexpy bridges to and "
"which it deliberately leaves out of scope, see [Where GWexpy Sits in the "
"GW Python Ecosystem](ecosystem)."
msgstr ""
"GWexpy がどのプロジェクトと変換連携し、どれを意図的に対象外としているかを含む完全な比較は"
"[GW Python エコシステムにおける GWexpy の位置付け](ecosystem)を参照してください。"

